      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "scallions",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the clams and cook until they are opened and lightly browned.",
    "Add the cooked rice to the skillet or wok and stir-fry for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the soy sauce, salt, and pepper, and stir-fry for another minute.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Transfer the fried rice to a serving platter and garnish with chopped scallions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
